% Menu-observer exclusion fixture (TODO_0277 soundness audit).
% The standing menu offers a GROUND stamp-matching rule (wood@2) — the
% coalescer must treat wood as stamp-load-bearing even though no static
% rule observes it: the player can project the alternative at any time.
% iron is observed by nothing and may coalesce.
wood: type.
plank: type.
iron: type.
dummy: type.

#expect_menu_observer (settle: 10)
  !( (wood@2 -o { plank })
   & (dummy -o { plank }) )
  * wood@2 * wood@3 * iron@1 * iron@4
  =>
  !_2 wood .
